 #copa-2027\nNotes: The official COPA 2027 page confirms the 16th symposiu
 m at the University of Genoa\, September 14-16\, 2027\, with full papers 
 due May 1\, 2-page poster abstracts due July 1 and author notification Ju
 ne 15. No hour or zone is stated\, so cutoffs use provisional end-of-day 
 AoE. COPA 2026 extended papers from May 1 to May 20 AoE and posters from 
 July 1 to August 1\, so check for extensions. Accepted papers and poster 
 abstracts appear in PMLR. The CMT COPA2027 site requires login\, so openi
 ng is unverified. Annual since 2012. Size S reflects 47 full papers and 1
 9 extended abstracts in PMLR vol. 329 (2026)\; attendance is not publishe
 d. Size is an editorial estimate.
